{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f331a55c-503e-5f50-97be-723513dcecfd", "source_ordinal": 735, "reading_ordinal": 3322, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "精力有限", "published_at": "2025-06-13T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/4e235a46423c11f08bca5254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你有没有问过自己一个问题——所谓“教育子女”，到底是指什么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "是指“获得最高高考总分”吗？", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "狗屁。", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "是在子女离开家独立生活时，帮助子女获得深受自然法祝福的绝对乐观。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是到了ta要独立生活的那一天，就算天上掉下一块陨石把爹妈砸死了、房子炸飞了、人也毁容了、身体也瘫痪了、就剩还没脑死亡了，护士（也有男护士）晚上来一接脑电波，ta屏幕上也输出一行字——", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "“Hey beautiful，how are you doing～   /wink.”", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "是趁着你还能够得着、使得上劲、说得上话，帮ta获得对恐惧的免疫。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "要教会ta和一切导致恐惧的心魔防御、缠斗、征服的技术和经验。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所谓的“学习”也罢，“考试”也罢，“游历”也罢，“娱乐”也罢……一切的一切，都是服务于这一个目标。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这些本质上都只是用来产生“下一场挑战”的情节发生器。", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 359}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "它本身产生的什么胜负、得分，根本不重要，重要的是经历了这些关卡，打过了这么多对战，你的子女有没有获得对人生的更强的期待和信心。", "char_start": 360, "char_end": 423}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "高考成绩的确是——但也只是——对这个结果有所帮助的若干因素之一。", "char_start": 424, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这话什么意思？", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "意思是如果你对它的追求会导致你的子女对余下的人生的期待趋向绝望，那么这个绝望就是你该补的最短板。", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 513}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你得让ta想要活下去——真诚地、热切地、兴致勃勃地想要活下去。", "char_start": 514, "char_end": 545}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而你现在问的这个“是该补短板还是补长板”的问题，已经有几个危险的兆头：", "char_start": 546, "char_end": 581}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "1）这个问题里你甚至不觉得有必要加上“学习”“科目”这个字样来限定短板和长板的含义。很显然你现在眼里已经默认这只可能是指学习的短板和长板。", "char_start": 582, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你眼里根本就没有从“热爱生命”这个根本指导原则来考虑短板和长板的意识存在。", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 689}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这就像一个搞健身的人眼里已经只剩健美比赛的排名，而已经完全忘记了“健身是为了延寿”这个根本目的一样。", "char_start": 690, "char_end": 740}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "再这么“健身”下去，连命都不见得保得住，还谈排名？", "char_start": 741, "char_end": 766}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "离题是万恶之源，你在追求什么，你就会得到什么。你该追求的是A，只要你无意识的打着追求A的旗号滑向追求B这个中间体，不论你是否得到B，你都在失去A。", "char_start": 767, "char_end": 840}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "失去A，得到B毫无意义。", "char_start": 841, "char_end": 853}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "再说一遍——毫无意义。", "char_start": 854, "char_end": 865}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "随时随地、每分每秒都要记住你到底是在干嘛。记不住，写在墙上、刻在桌子上。", "char_start": 866, "char_end": 902}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "再记不住，纹在手背上。", "char_start": 903, "char_end": 914}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "2）对这个“造就绝对乐观”的根本目标，存在一个最基本的原则——具体路径并不像看上去那么重要。", "char_start": 916, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "补强科有补强科的好，补弱科有补弱科的好。不休学有不休学的好，休学也有休学的好。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 1002}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你要做的不是去焦虑到底哪个更好，而是你要把你选择的——或者不如说你遇上的——那个命运安排里应有的好扎扎实实的拿到手。", "char_start": 1003, "char_end": 1061}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "没拿到，也有没拿到的好，同样并不致命。", "char_start": 1062, "char_end": 1081}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "看懂没有？这种淡定和平静的乐观？", "char_start": 1082, "char_end": 1098}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "我想干什么，只要不涉及作恶，我都不纠结这样干的所谓“不好”，不在意它的所谓“机会损失”。它产生经验，那当然好；产生教训，那更加好。", "char_start": 1099, "char_end": 1164}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "它发生得早，那真真好。", "char_start": 1165, "char_end": 1176}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "它让我输得刻骨铭心，那可更加好。", "char_start": 1177, "char_end": 1193}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你要停止用“这个选择是对的，那个选择是错的”这种语气讲话。", "char_start": 1194, "char_end": 1223}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "否则你的子女会在这十几二十年里被无可避免的几个错误抓住，在二十几岁就开始沉迷于“我当初真不该犯下那几个大错”，陷入“我已经毁了我最好的可能”这种蠢念，不断的支付愚蠢的利息。", "char_start": 1224, "char_end": 1310}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "ta是会由此产生死志的。", "char_start": 1311, "char_end": 1323}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "是要进鬼门关里去走一趟，才能看运气能不能逃出一条命的。", "char_start": 1324, "char_end": 1351}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "除了以恶为业，这个世界上没有任何“错”，只有不同的观景路线。", "char_start": 1352, "char_end": 1382}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "不必“两难”，不需要什么“伟大的智慧”，说得不好听点，你扔硬币都可以。", "char_start": 1383, "char_end": 1418}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "“选择”根本不重要，重要的是“选择”之后要尽心、尽情、尽兴的享受你的选择。", "char_start": 1419, "char_end": 1456}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "随便ta选，也随便你选，让一切的选择都变成“这种开局怎么开心的玩”的谜题，就像随机生成数独题然后去解数独那样。", "char_start": 1457, "char_end": 1512}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "你放心，这个“随机乱转”的安排，只要加上你“随遇而喜”的努力，最后一定换你一个全世界任何人都无法复制的独特优势。只要你能把这独一无二的优势产品化、服务化，这个地球上少说也有个十来万人抢着买。", "char_start": 1513, "char_end": 1608}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "而最坏的选择，就是一路跟着所谓的“主流最佳方案”，抱着越积越深的“我怎么又选错了”的悔恨，用越来越意兴阑珊、心不在焉的所谓“努力”姿态，去参与最残酷激烈的、最白热化的竞争。", "char_start": 1609, "char_end": 1695}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "你这样去玩这游戏，要是不输到屁滚尿流，老天岂不是瞎了眼？", "char_start": 1696, "char_end": 1724}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "看懂没有？", "char_start": 1726, "char_end": 1731}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "你这个问题的问法，就是一个心毒深种而不自知的问法。", "char_start": 1732, "char_end": 1757}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "你这个要命的错误心态，已经不知不觉向子女滴灌了多少焦虑。", "char_start": 1758, "char_end": 1786}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "这个无孔不入、无色无臭，然而却能让ta上学步都迈不动、上课眼皮都抬不起来的毒，才是你孩子“精力有限”的病根。", "char_start": 1787, "char_end": 1841}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "否则十几岁的孩子，连着三天三夜不睡觉连个黑眼圈都没有的年纪，什么tm的精力有限？", "char_start": 1842, "char_end": 1882}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "你让ta打游戏看看ta精力有不有限？", "char_start": 1883, "char_end": 1901}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "ta精力有限，是要逼着你接受某些科目的“就这样了”，ta已经中毒太深，都快抬不起胳膊了。", "char_start": 1902, "char_end": 1946}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "看懂了没有？", "char_start": 1947, "char_end": 1953}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "你要解决的是“精力有限”本身，而不是“有限的精力拿来补哪块板”！", "char_start": 1954, "char_end": 1986}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "自己去反省吧。", "char_start": 1987, "char_end": 1994}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "不反省清楚，ta“精力”再“有限”下去，连床都会起不来了。", "char_start": 1995, "char_end": 2024}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "还“补板”？", "char_start": 2025, "char_end": 2031}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 62}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0479"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子时间精力有限，是花在长板上精益求精，还是补齐短板?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056"], "summary": "围绕“精力有限”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你有没有问过自己一个问题——所谓“教育子女”，到底是指什么？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你有没有问过自己一个问题——所谓“教育子女”，到底是指什么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e020318f-ba10-524b-8c6c-bd4e0fd5a1e0", "source_ordinal": 734, "reading_ordinal": 3323, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "政治头脑", "published_at": "2025-06-14T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/b1cb85b042fe11f09f0a5254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很多人觉得政治头脑是指治国理政、管理国家民族的命运、参与国际秩序的重塑，或者最低限度的——能猜出当前的社会动向、政策趋势。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但这其实不是政治头脑的主要战场。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "政治存在于每一个角落，从组织公司团建到协调项目相关利益方，从掌握酒桌气氛到反制、分化霸凌小团体，从应付市政检查到组织业主维权……一切涉及群体动力学的博弈，本质上都是政治的博弈。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "所谓政治头脑，就是参与、预测和影响群体博弈的洞察力和策略能力。", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "知道谁会在什么阶段支持谁到什么程度，又会因为什么条件的改变而改变其支持的方向和力度。这些条件有多少会在多大的程度上成为现实，而又如何可以改变这些概率的时间分布。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "某种意义上讲，这几乎可以说是一种音乐才能。", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "美术是沿空间轴展开的艺术，音乐是沿时间轴展开的艺术，政治头脑——在本质上是一种看见诸多要素随时间轴穿插演变的能力，仿佛看到若干个声部沿着时间轴的此起彼伏互相对抗、协调，而又凭着这预见，在这里调高某个声部的某几个小节，在那里对一个音轨加上回音或渐隐滤镜。四两拨千斤，引导整个曲风和乐章走向自己想要的情绪和情节。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而这四两千斤之效，最大的奥秘在于能从这人类的交响曲中看见乐理。", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 489}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这是一种音乐工程学，一种时间的艺术。", "char_start": 490, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你能看见回荡在人类之中的这种“曲子”，对社会动力的流向有这样近乎通感、宛如实物的觉察，你就算“有政治头脑”。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 563}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这个能力，必然是建立在大量事实求是的观察基础之上的。", "char_start": 564, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而能做到这个“大量实事求是的观察”的前提，是你足够关心——真正的关心。", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 626}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "能养成政治头脑的人有一个基本的特征——从不会说“不关我事”。", "char_start": 627, "char_end": 657}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "一切都关ta事，所以ta才会不惜踏破铁鞋、不耻下问的去看。", "char_start": 658, "char_end": 687}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以ta才会看见。", "char_start": 688, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "就是这样。", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 703}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0479"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么算拥有政治头脑?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“政治头脑”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很多人觉得政治头脑是指治国理政、管理国家民族的命运、参与国际秩序的重塑，或者最低限度的——能猜出当前的社会动向、政策趋势。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很多人觉得政治头脑是指治国理政、管理国家民族的命运、参与国际秩序的重塑，或者最低限度的——能猜出当前的社会动向、政策趋势。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 61, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "107d7eff-c9f3-58ad-96b8-97602ae83cbe", "source_ordinal": 733, "reading_ordinal": 3324, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "我和我的", "published_at": "2025-06-14T22:35:00.850000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/5508159327/answer/1917349044377879555"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "受“我”的意志驱使的，就是“我的”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我要眨眼，这眼就眨了。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我要举手，这手就举了。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我要说，这嘴就动了，这喉就响了。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我因为这种关系而判断这是“我的”。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我的身体、我的工具、我的财产，都是根据这种无需翻译、不经中介的驱动关系测量、核实出来的。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你也可以换一个时髦的说法，就想象你的身体是一组式神，你其实是从婴儿时期开始逐个逐个的跟“它们”“签订契约”，最后才攒满你的肉身的。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "只是那个“仪式”发生在你还没有长期记忆的早期，所以你没有相关的记忆罢了。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "是这个驱动关系连接了你和这些东西，合成了完整的你。", "char_start": 226, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "某种程度上，所谓的“我”，其实是在祈使句中因为默认而可以被省略的那个对象。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 289}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "要让任何别的事物服从指令，都必须在发出指令时附加指令对象。例如“炮二平六”，“炮二”这个对象是无从省略的；然而当你省去祈使的对象，“前进四”就是在指“（我）前进四”。", "char_start": 290, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所谓的“我”，就是在别无所指时默认承接指令的那个对象，这也是“我”与“意志之我”关系最亲近的原因。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 423}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "“我”服从我的指令，无需召唤，不必说服，不用解释，从不推诿，从不应付。", "char_start": 424, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "所以它才是“我”。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 469}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0479"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：7 岁女儿问「我」为什么在「我的身体」里？为什么这个身体里的「我」是「我」?如何与这个年龄的孩子讨论？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“我和我的”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“受“我”的意志驱使的，就是“我的”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "受“我”的意志驱使的，就是“我的”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "da6f5c1c-e01b-5f75-abb3-fbf29b15c36f", "source_ordinal": 732, "reading_ordinal": 3325, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "妈妈岗", "published_at": "2025-06-15T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/f687e8ce43bc11f0813b52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有人觉得这些岗位会是一些倒咖啡、复印文件、代订午餐的职位，基本上是基于内心恐慌对现实的wishful thinking。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "妈妈岗更可能是财务总监、大客户经理、咨询顾问这一类的中高级职位。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因为这类女性——我是指那些被企业垂涎、宁可做出制度妥协也要招揽、囊括的女性人才，基本上都是因为生育责任不得不转向时间灵活、在线协作的女性精英。", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 165}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "都是些英语流利、专业熟练、气质优雅、洞察人心、心狠手辣的人。", "char_start": 166, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "若不是算得清账、看得清人心，而且足够心狠手辣，这些人不会断然放弃自己的职业前途去育儿。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "换了男性坐在这个位置上，自己下一下这个决心就知道这需要多大的决绝。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "对别人狠，可以靠贪婪和愚蠢凑勇气；对自己狠，看出不及时截肢会失去更多就能操起刀把手砍断，这样的女性才有可能真的从成功的职业生涯里一声不吭去当“老妈子”，而且能愿赌服输，不拿这个在家人面前念叨、邀功。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "只是因为这些人知道如果企业没有这个制度准备，单靠自己的优秀能力很难自己去推动企业做这种妥协。强推可以，但既然是你推动企业为你做这么大的自我定制和修改，你就要为这个“人情”付出多得多的额外报酬。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 471}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这是个不划算的勉强，智者不取。", "char_start": 472, "char_end": 487}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但如果企业自己就有这个明确自觉，自己来跟这些拿着刀正准备壮士断腕的女性豪杰谈有什么可能不必如此，那这个妥协就可以在不必付出这份额外的政治资本的前提下更好的达成一致。", "char_start": 488, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这就可以谈，手可以不必砍了，刀就可以放下了。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这才是“妈妈岗”的主要实践，而不是什么打扫、复印、点餐。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "什么时候打杂可以时间自由了？", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "昨天开了会明天又要开，今天晚上必须把会场收拾干净布置成明天的会场格局，你给“妈妈岗”一个看看？", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "标书明天下午就必须要寄出去，所有人都在疯狂打印、校订、封装，你说声“我要接娃”试试？", "char_start": 686, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "代点餐，你一天点一天不点试试？谁耐得烦记得你儿子什么时候考试？", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 760}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "越是低端杂活，反而越是不允许三天打鱼两天晒网的。", "char_start": 761, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你们自己不就是活例子吗？你们自己不就在成天吐槽自己作为低级牛马没日没夜，高管却爱来不来、时隐时现吗？", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 836}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "怎么一到“妈妈岗”就开始幻想存在大量“低薪但却赛神仙”的工作了？", "char_start": 837, "char_end": 869}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "靠点谱。", "char_start": 870, "char_end": 874}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0479"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：湖北全面推行“妈妈岗”，你怎么看？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“妈妈岗”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有人觉得这些岗位会是一些倒咖啡、复印文件、代订午餐的职位，基本上是基于内心恐慌对现实的wishful thinking。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有人觉得这些岗位会是一些倒咖啡、复印文件、代订午餐的职位，基本上是基于内心恐慌对现实的wishful thinking。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "06c852a2-23fb-59c6-88f9-5669da85c66d", "source_ordinal": 731, "reading_ordinal": 3326, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "六连响", "published_at": "2025-06-15T23:20:53.584000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1911730139122860780/answer/1917722445139412276"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "在美国人发明左轮手枪之前，用燧发手枪的白人殖民者开两枪的间隔之间，一名印第安勇士可以骑马奔出200米，并连续射出4箭，还能抛出两柄飞斧。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这是一个值得你牢记的意象。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "什么意思呢？", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "意思是在上一代技术非常成熟的末期，基于新原理的新技术往往不会在第一代获得压倒性的优势，甚至常常是劣势。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 141}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "第一代的蒸汽机干不过水力纺织，第一代的火车跑不过马车，第一代的汽车跑不过马，第一代的火枪射不过弓箭。", "char_start": 142, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "甚至还不是差着一点半点，而是远远不如、形如笑谈。", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 217}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但历史的发展往往是新技术发展到第二版、第三版时，旧技术霸主们开始笑不出来了。", "char_start": 218, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "六联装弹仓的双枪骑士可以以猛烈得多的节奏倾泻12发子弹，而他再用上快速装弹器，一次装填就增加六发子弹，再神勇的弓手也难望其项背。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而那个时候才放下弓箭来制造枪支的印第安人，造出来的第一代枪械未必就比当初败在ta们弓箭下的那第一代产品好。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这才是蔚来这个世界模型的要害所在——它是那把还时不时会卡壳的枪，它已经不是弓箭了。", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "印第安勇士们固然现在仍然神功无敌，但新的故事已经另起开头了。", "char_start": 418, "char_end": 448}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0479"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：蔚来世界大模型NWM的智驾在行业里处于什么水平？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“六连响”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“在美国人发明左轮手枪之前，用燧发手枪的白人殖民者开两枪的间隔之间，一名印第安勇士可以骑马奔出200米，并连续射出4箭，还能抛出两柄飞斧。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "在美国人发明左轮手枪之前，用燧发手枪的白人殖民者开两枪的间隔之间，一名印第安勇士可以骑马奔出200米，并连续射出4箭，还能抛出两柄飞斧。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4aa6161d-a893-5470-954b-dcfe2cd4dd7a", "source_ordinal": 730, "reading_ordinal": 3327, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "魔丸真火", "published_at": "2025-06-16T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/f41dddd443f611f0907b52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这种行为看上去似乎很聪明，但实际上是很蠢的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "蠢在哪？蠢在敌人也是分等级的。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“输了就认输”的敌人和“输了就让人赢不成”的敌人是两种敌人。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "公然宣布后一政策的人最大的危险是什么？", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是那些潜伏在暗处、你觉得还不是你敌人的朋友、路人，一旦ta们意识到你和ta的利益有无可避免的冲突，对方考虑的就不是“通过博弈达成新的合作方式”，而是“一击致命”。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 171}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为你这个人“不会善罢甘休”。", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你不可能在只有你一方受损的节点上接受和平。而对方已经预见到你即将遭遇一个必然因ta受损的局面。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "对方的合理选择就只能是从毫无征兆的和平状态一步走向直接剥夺你的反击能力。", "char_start": 236, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "对方才是发起第一击的那一方，在对方发起第一击之前，你根本没有什么“单输 / 双输”的选择机会；而对方一旦决定对你动手，因为提前就知道你是个输不起的人，就会在第一击就保证你万劫不复。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你宣布这种“信条”，其实是在找死。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 381}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "只有那些长期坚持“得饶人处且饶人”“单赢好过双输”的人，才在事实上反而有机会选择临时变轨，出人意料的选择“双输好过单赢”。", "char_start": 382, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你宣布了，你反而没有这选择。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这还只是害处之一。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "害处之二——对方身边一共有四个可供选择的对抗对手，其中只有你宣告“双输胜过单赢”。你盘算的是“这样我比较凶，别人会先捏软柿子”。", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 533}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "实际上你却会是最先出局的那个。", "char_start": 534, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为你这种人没朋友。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 560}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "其他人会看着你被伏击，甚至会暗暗庆幸有人把你清除——因为你没事就会觉得自己“输”了，然后要拿着这个由头去拉别人“双输”。", "char_start": 561, "char_end": 621}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "谁没见过人吃你这种亏？否则大家怎么知道你这名声的？", "char_start": 622, "char_end": 647}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "谁想当下一个？", "char_start": 648, "char_end": 655}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "所以现在“恶人有了恶人磨”，谁要来救你？", "char_start": 656, "char_end": 676}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "四个人里面你就是最软的柿子，而且是最毒的那个。弄谁都要考虑兔死狐悲，会不会有路人觉得我太残暴，要联合抗击。", "char_start": 677, "char_end": 730}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "但弄你这个顾虑小得多，弄不好乡亲们还送一面“小周处”的锦旗。", "char_start": 731, "char_end": 761}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你还觉得摆出这副架势是个好主意吗？", "char_start": 762, "char_end": 779}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "年轻人最容易犯的错误，就是以为露出尖牙利齿会赢得更高地位和更大优待，殊不知人类社会普遍遵循的是“要将隐患扼杀在摇篮里”的逻辑。", "char_start": 780, "char_end": 843}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "谁会蠢到等魔丸这种调性的人学会三昧真火？第一集就是核平陈塘关了。", "char_start": 844, "char_end": 876}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "理论上，魔丸最好的——甚至是唯一可行的——做法是先低调高唱爱与和平，等学会了三昧真火和三头六臂再突然翻脸喊“双输胜单赢”。", "char_start": 877, "char_end": 938}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "但实际上，要么魔丸自认为三昧真火已经天下无敌喊出双输口号时发现上面还有观音大士和如来佛祖，自己还是喊早了，被一巴掌打落凡尘；要么魔丸在低头练功期间看见各种不同编号的魔丸被各种不同型号的观音大士斗战胜佛打得魂飞魄散而终于意识到最朴素的事实——其实根本没有喊出这句口号而不增加风险的时候。", "char_start": 939, "char_end": 1081}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "什么时候喊，都喊得太早了。在比你更深的深渊里总有比你块头更大的克苏鲁。", "char_start": 1082, "char_end": 1117}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "低头发展，喊啥喊？", "char_start": 1118, "char_end": 1127}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0479"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待时下被部分网民力推的“双输好过单赢”观念？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“魔丸真火”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这种行为看上去似乎很聪明，但实际上是很蠢的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这种行为看上去似乎很聪明，但实际上是很蠢的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4f977534-1fc7-581c-af83-d0746f0a3a1a", "source_ordinal": 729, "reading_ordinal": 3328, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "鸳鸯锅", "published_at": "2025-06-16T21:25:54.955000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/631595282/answer/1917940463425519788"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这其实答案都是明摆着的：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“我对这个问题的合规性有疑虑，所以我要跟合规部门 / 纪律部门 / 监管部门 请教清楚，确认这个操作的合规性再签字。”", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我也不知道合不合法，你等我先问问纪委的同志。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这属于正常的合规操作——企业内没有任何操作是可以对合规部门保密的，你不清楚是否合规，按照企业制度理所当然的应该请合规部门预审。如果你这事内部没有规定和先例，那就要行业监管部门来提前确认无罪。", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你看ta能不能让你拿去给合规部门看。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "ta能，你就按这个搞法让合规部门先点头，点完头就没你的事了。ta敢这样一般也意味着确实没啥大事。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 259}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "ta不能，自然偃旗息鼓、不敢再提，你也不必纠结了。", "char_start": 260, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "如果你只是一个下级办事员，这就是标准操作，这根本不需要你来纠结，制度已经给你保障了。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "真要纠结，你自己得是那个无上级可请示的人、最后把关人，比如财务总监、技术总监……整个组织范围内你就是最高权威，只有你替别人分担责任，没人能替你分担责任了。", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但你如果是这个地位，你对企业就是举足轻重，对方只能拿感情、利诱来诱惑你，其实没能力硬逼。", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 451}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "对方能硬逼，看准的是你自己内心的软弱，哪怕有底牌、有合法权力，你也会害怕“得罪人”、害怕“面子上不好看”，会在心理软弱的驱使下就范。", "char_start": 452, "char_end": 518}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这个就是你自己的人生功课了。", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 533}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这么说吧，做到总监一级，就要有能“微笑着开枪”的罡气。", "char_start": 534, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "抬手对ta膝盖一枪，然后照样笑眯眯的约ta晚上吃火锅。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 589}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "ta挨了这一枪，火锅还得好好吃。", "char_start": 590, "char_end": 606}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "不然还要再挨一枪，火锅都没得吃。", "char_start": 607, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "看你刚挨了一枪，算了，火锅就点鸳鸯的吧。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 644}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0479"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：体制内领导逼你签不该签的字怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“鸳鸯锅”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这其实答案都是明摆着的：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这其实答案都是明摆着的：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "13a92ae9-f058-52ea-a234-cc10980c0ce5", "source_ordinal": 728, "reading_ordinal": 3329, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "善良的门把手", "published_at": "2025-06-17T02:13:32.751000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/13704924198/answer/1918075890790802068"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "抑郁症的根源是傲慢。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“自我认证善良”只是傲慢的一种经典症状。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我一点错没有、一点罪也没有，那就是什么都不用改也什么都不能改。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "一点错、一点罪都没有，改了，岂不是把对的、无罪的，改成了错的、有罪的？", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所以输入参数不能有任何变化。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "输入参数“不可能有错”，但结果不好，那就“只能”是程序有问题、系统有问题。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "是世界要为辜负你而自我忏悔、请求你的饶恕来自我救赎。", "char_start": 153, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "到这里，世界输得干干净净。", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "它只是死不认账。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "自认为是因为自己“过于善良”才得抑郁症的“孩子”，基本全是这个套路。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "然后你问几个世界如何辜负的案例，不是“时间地点人物都说不清，但别人的罪恶是确定无疑的”，就是出现大量私有的、极为含糊的、但却“天经地义”的道德准则。", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "ta们是在一个根本没有确切定义的善良标准下无可置疑的善良，然后再因为这种“无可置疑的善良”，被世界“辜负”。", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这算是因为“善良”而抑郁吗？", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "“善良”是一门极其极其复杂的学问，绝非“自觉无辜”就可以自我认证的。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "它是需要巨大的阅读量、巨大的实践量才能摸得到门把手的东西，坦率讲，二十几岁的人能确切的、靠谱的摸准谁善良、谁不善良的概率极低。", "char_start": 418, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "低到不值得期待。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "低到你一旦把问题归结为“我太善良”，从概率上讲这是一种无知无畏的傲慢的概率大到小数点后第七八位的程度。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 542}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这没有任何轻视、侮辱年轻人之处，因为即使是成年人，也没有把小数点挪动几位。", "char_start": 543, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "可以这么说，知道善良问题复杂到何等程度，以至于不敢随口出声，这才是摸到了善良的门把手的人的应有状态。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你是因为傲慢。", "char_start": 632, "char_end": 639}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "不是因为善良。", "char_start": 640, "char_end": 647}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "heading", "index": 22, "text": "这个世界上，没人能因为善良抑郁，因为善良恰恰是抑郁的药。", "char_start": 648, "char_end": 676}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0479"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：你认同「善良的孩子容易得抑郁症」这类说法吗？为什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“善良的门把手”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“抑郁症的根源是傲慢。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "抑郁症的根源是傲慢。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
